him the clip of him shooting the dog. The video&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:46.000
disturbes the audience. Hitler is angered and&nbsp;
threatens him that he would do the same to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:51.120
him. He further says that he will turn their&nbsp;
studio into a parking lot for tanks. Christoph&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:56.960
gets happier seeing people's negative responses.&nbsp;
After the disastrous interview, Bellini is fired,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:56.960 --> 00:11:02.160
and Christoph is appointed as the new manager.
After that, Hitler goes to Fabian's house and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:07.440
starts living with him. He expresses amusement at&nbsp;
the path taken by destiny and starts to write his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:07.440 --> 00:11:12.480
second book. The book soon hits the market.
Three months later, at the TV studio,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:17.520
everyone sits in a meeting where the massive loss&nbsp;
that the company has gone through is discussed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:22.720
Christoph believes that Witzigmann's show will&nbsp;
put them back on track, but one employee informs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:28.000
him that he has quit his job. Christoph gets&nbsp;
tensed and gets mad at the selected employees&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:33.280
for losing the show. One of the staff suggests&nbsp;
getting Hitler back which interests Christoph.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:37.760
He looks for Hitler again and offers Fabian&nbsp;
that he will invest a million in the film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:43.040
that Fabian and Hitler are shooting if they in&nbsp;
return let them broadcast the movie on their TV.
&nbsp;

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:48.720
Hitler and Fabian come to Kromeier's house&nbsp;
where Kromeier's grandmother identifies Hitler.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:53.520
She claims that Hitler gassed all the people up&nbsp;
and killed them. She calls him a criminal and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:58.960
shouts him to get out. In the car, Hitler shares&nbsp;
that he is surprised at Kromeier being a Jew.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:58.960 --> 00:12:04.160
He starts to belittle jews calling them&nbsp;
less of humans. Fabian gets disappointed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:08.960
at Hitler's actions and his words.
Back in the set, Fabian gets Hitler to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:08.960 --> 00:12:13.840
replay how he got to the place. He asks Hitler&nbsp;
what happened before the ball came rolling to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:13.840 --> 00:12:18.720
him in the woods but Hitler cannot remember&nbsp;
it. Later at night, he walks out of the set&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:24.080
and is surrounded by some thugs. They call him the&nbsp;
reason to take Germany back and give him a hard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:30.080
blow on his face. As Hitler opens his eyes, he&nbsp;
finds himself in a hospital in front of Bellini.
&nbsp;

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:35.360
At the same time, Fabian looks over the footage of&nbsp;
the video he captured about the boys and soccer.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:40.400
He looks closely at it and finds Hitler rose&nbsp;
from where he was lying. Fabian gets amazed at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:44.960
what happened before it. He quickly goes to&nbsp;
the place and finds a board at the location&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:49.440
stating the Historical location of&nbsp;
‘Fuhrer Bunker’. Fabian rushes to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:49.440 --> 00:12:54.000
hospital but doesn't find Hitler. Bellini&nbsp;
says that he is headed to the shooting set.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:59.760
Fabian reveals that he is the real Adolf Hitler&nbsp;
but Bellini does not believe him. Fabian acts mad&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:04.400
and tries to explain his theory hysterically.&nbsp;
The guards try to catch him, but he flees.
&nbsp;

00:13:05.520 --> 00:13:10.560
Fabian then reaches the set and aims a gun&nbsp;
at Hitler. When asked about his identity,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:15.600
Hitler explains that he never claimed to be anyone&nbsp;
else. Fabian says that Hitler is fooling people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:20.800
with his propaganda to which Hitler replies that&nbsp;
people elected a leader who shared his whole idea&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:27.120
openly in 1933. Fabian takes Hitler to the top&nbsp;
of a building with his gun. He corners Hitler&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:32.880
and declares him to be a monster. Hitler, inturn&nbsp;
claps back saying that ordinary people elected an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:38.400
extraordinary man and entrusted the fate of the&nbsp;
country to him. He explains that people chose him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:43.920
because they bear the same values in their inner&nbsp;
hearts. An enraged Fabian shoots Hitler, making&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:49.520
him fall down the building, onto the street.&nbsp;
Soon, Fabian hears Hitler’s voice, who says that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:49.520 --> 00:13:54.880
no German can get rid of him. And Hitler, who was&nbsp;
just thrown down, appears right behind it again.
&nbsp;

00:13:55.520 --> 00:14:00.800
Just then, Bellina calls for a cut in the&nbsp;
studio, and everyone cheers for the shoot.Turns&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:05.040
out that it was just a film shoot and a&nbsp;
random actor was playing the role of Fabian.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:09.520
Hitler then asks everyone to remember the&nbsp;
comrades who could not be with them. 
&nbsp;

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:14.480
Somewhere else, Kromeier is sobbing seeing&nbsp;
Fabian through a hole in the mental ward. 
&nbsp;

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:19.840
Hitler and Bellina are busy giving autographs&nbsp;
and interviews to people after the film booms.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:24.000
As they pass by a car, the people&nbsp;
on the street seem fond of Hitler&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:28.400
and greet him with respect. 
